### 16:40–16:55 · Standup có ghi âm

> *"Morning. Last week I finished MacroZone following a course, and got my first EAS build running on a real device.*
> *This week I'm going beyond the course. Today I built a proper theming system — light and dark palettes with shared design tokens, a theme context, and persistence so the choice survives a restart. It also follows the system setting if you want it to.*
> *Tomorrow I'll add a stats screen and swap the list over to FlashList.*
> *One thing I want to look into is whether I'm re-creating stylesheets too often on re-render — I used useMemo for now but I'd like to profile it properly later."*

**Câu cuối là kỹ thuật cao trong phỏng vấn:** tự nêu một điểm chưa chắc chắn kèm kế hoạch kiểm chứng. Nó cho thấy bạn có tiêu chuẩn, không phải bạn yếu.

